@startuml
title Learning Domain

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "learning.domain.model" {
  class LearningGoal <<Aggregate Root>> {
    - id: LearningGoalId
    - title: GoalTitle
    - description: GoalDescription
    - period: GoalPeriod
    - status: GoalStatus
    + changeTitle(title)
    + changeDescription(description)
    + changePeriod(period)
    + complete()
    + isActive()
  }

  class StudySession <<Aggregate Root>> {
    - id: StudySessionId
    - learningGoalId: LearningGoalId
    - studyDate: LocalDate
    - duration: StudyDuration
    - content: StudySessionContent
    + revise(studyDate, duration, content)
  }

  class LearningGoalId <<Value Object>>
  class StudySessionId <<Value Object>>
  class GoalTitle <<Value Object>>
  class GoalDescription <<Value Object>>
  class GoalPeriod <<Value Object>>
  class StudyDuration <<Value Object>>
  class StudySessionContent <<Value Object>>

  enum GoalStatus {
    PLANNED
    ACTIVE
    COMPLETED
    ARCHIVED
  }
}

package "learning.domain.repository" {
  interface LearningGoalRepository {
    + save(goal)
    + findById(id)
    + findActive()
  }

  interface StudySessionRepository {
    + save(session)
    + findById(id)
    + findByLearningGoalId(learningGoalId)
    + sumDurationByLearningGoalId(learningGoalId)
  }
}

LearningGoal *-- LearningGoalId
LearningGoal *-- GoalTitle
LearningGoal *-- GoalDescription
LearningGoal *-- GoalPeriod
LearningGoal *-- GoalStatus

StudySession *-- StudySessionId
StudySession --> LearningGoalId : references by identity
StudySession *-- StudyDuration
StudySession *-- StudySessionContent

LearningGoalRepository ..> LearningGoal
StudySessionRepository ..> StudySession

note right of LearningGoal
Type:
Aggregate Root

Responsibility:
Manage a technical learning objective and its lifecycle.

Aggregate boundary:
LearningGoal only. StudySession is not owned.

Invariants:
- title is not blank
- target date is not before start date
- completed goal cannot be changed back to active in this design

Business Rules:
- complete() changes status to COMPLETED
- active goals are queryable through repository

Dependencies:
Pure Java only

Persistence:
Saved as one LearningGoal aggregate
end note

note right of StudySession
Type:
Aggregate Root

Responsibility:
Record one actual learning activity.

Aggregate boundary:
StudySession only. LearningGoal is referenced by LearningGoalId.

Invariants:
- learningGoalId is required
- studyDate is required
- duration is positive
- content is not blank

Business Rules:
- revise() can correct date, duration, content, and note
- total study time is calculated from StudySession records
- calculated study time may be zero when no sessions match

Dependencies:
Pure Java only

Persistence:
Saved as one StudySession aggregate
end note

note bottom of StudySessionRepository
Type:
Repository

Responsibility:
Persist StudySession and provide query operations needed by the learning context.

Business Rules:
Does not own duration calculation rules beyond aggregation query support.

Persistence:
Implemented by infrastructure persistence adapter.
end note

@enduml
